Modified on 2026-10-23 for Lyra by Akshay K Rooben Abraham and contributors.

KeywordMatcher.kt is copied from Curbox's utils/KeywordMatcher.kt with the
package declaration changed and provenance added. accessibility_service.xml is
adapted from Curbox's app_blocker_service_config.xml. Curbox's event-driven
application/keyword blocker design is reduced to an AI-only redirect service;
the service, policy, native UI, PIN settings and managed-device controls are Lyra
modifications. gradlew, gradlew.bat, gradle-wrapper.jar and wrapper properties
are retained from the upstream Gradle setup. Gradle wrapper components retain
their Apache-2.0 licensing; see LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

Version 0.2.0 adds a warm glass UI, randomized local popup messages, an expanded
AI catalog and dismissible YouTube Shorts reminders. ShortsPolicy's visible
player IDs are adapted from Curbox hardcoded/ReelAppConfig.youtubeScript.
Bundled Android icon copies have been recolored orange for this version.

